OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThree men jailed for 'sectarian'
OL,4,Aattack on Celtic fan after Old Firm
OL,5,Aclash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe three all pled guilty to assault to
OL,8,Fdanger of life, with the procurator
OL,9,Ffiscal describing the crime as
OL,10,F"mindless sectarian thuggery".
OL,12,FDragsness, from Belfast, was sentenced
OL,13,Fto 18 months in prison while Stanex,
OL,14,Ffrom Belfast, and Graham, from
OL,15,FDundonald, both received 12 months.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
